WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.320
Thank you so much for joining us, by the way.

00:00:02.320 --> 00:00:05.880
You've called the district judge's ruling

00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:08.160
blocking the deployment of National Guard in Oregon

00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:10.280
legal insurrection.

00:00:10.280 --> 00:00:13.920
Does the administration still plan to abide by that ruling?

